/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_581f7754_19.txt:736:#    The generator builds the partition first, then places anchors and sprites inside
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_581f7754_19.txt:745:#    Objects never cross the partition, anchors remain isolated singletons, and
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_581f7754_19.txt:754:    Slide interior sprites toward the border anchor that matches both their marker color and their background partition.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_581f7754_19.txt:759:    - Border anchors are isolated non-background singletons, and the same anchor color may appear once in each region.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_581f7754_19.txt:763:    - Match a sprite to the anchor of the same marker color inside that same region.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_581f7754_19.txt:764:    - Top/bottom anchors align the marker's column by horizontal sliding; left/right anchors align the marker's row by vertical sliding.
